summary: Verify the auth.sshd_static_host_keys manifest option controls static ssh host key generation
description: |
  Compiles AIB manifests (via --dry-run --osbuild-manifest) and inspects the
  resulting osbuild manifest to verify that the `pregen_ssh_host_keys`
  lorax-script stage (which generates the static ssh host keys embedded in the
  image) is included or excluded according to the `auth.sshd_static_host_keys`
  manifest option.

  Test inputs:
    Three a-i-b manifests:
      - enabled.aib.yml: sets `auth.sshd_static_host_keys: true`.
      - disabled.aib.yml: sets `auth.sshd_static_host_keys: false`.
      - default.aib.yml: does not set the option (defaults to true).

  Expected results:
    - PASS: 'Static ssh host key generation option validated successfully.'

  Results location:
    output.txt

duration: 30m
id: 1949ab81-72dc-46ea-af15-163848bef7e6
